\section{Full Simulation Testing \& Validation Protocol}

\subsection{Integrated Astro--CMD Test Run}

The validation pipeline executes coupled verification cycles across the astrophysical ingestion layer, SPH fluid dynamics solvers, and mucosal immune state-machines.

\begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{Initialization:} Load virtual patient profile and astrophysical boundary stream (stellar/MHD flow fields).
    \item \textbf{Full Simulation Test Run:}
    \begin{enumerate}
        \item Ingest stellar and MHD flow fields from the astrophysical data pipeline.
        \item Execute GPU-accelerated SPH slices over the domain.
        \item Calculate viscoelastic stress tensors in the coupled GI/mucosal interface.
        \item Evaluate mucosal barrier transcytosis and antigen transport.
        \item Update immune state automata matrix (CMD CTSHA core).
        \item Verify Hamiltonian energy bounds $\mathcal{H}(\mathbf{q},\mathbf{p})$ against theoretical limits.
    \end{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{Stability Branch:}
    \begin{itemize}
        \item If thresholds exceeded: apply adaptive damping to restore Lyapunov stability.
        \item If stable: stream telemetry to the visualization HUD.
    \end{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Clock Advancement:} Set $t \leftarrow t + \Delta t$.
\end{enumerate}

